<li>Pelatihan Gender oleh Yayasan Lembaga Bantuan Hukum Indonesia/YLBHI (2000)</li>
<li>Asian Human Rights Training and Study Session di FORUM ASIA oleh Universitas Chulalongkorn (2002)</li>
<li>Summer Camp on Human Rights oleh SKHU Universitas And ARENA (2007)</li>
<li>DTP on Human Rights, Advocacy, and Business Program: A Capacity Building Program for Advocates from the Asia-Pacific Region oleh Universitas New South Wales (2010)</li>
</ul>
